{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 8, "data": [{"docid2": 2050088, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202408/t20240812_2050088.htm", "content": "\n　　一是强化井工矿山重大灾害超前治理。加大隐蔽致灾因素普查成果运用，按照“就高不就低”原则，对所有地下矿山重新确定灾害等级，并在政务网站公示。督促煤与瓦斯突出、冲击地压、水文地质类型复杂极复杂矿井落实", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202408/t20240812_2050088.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.12 09:09:00", "doctitle": "《关于防范遏制矿山领域重特大生产安全事故的硬措施》中将采取哪些措施强化对重大灾害的超前治理？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2228729, "sourcename": "三明市应急管理局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202408/t20240812_2050088.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202408/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2024583, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/t20240511_2024583.htm", "content": "\n　　1.扶持对象：劳动年龄段内个人创业。   2.扶持政策：创业担保贷款、一次性创业补贴、创业带动就业补贴、省级大学生资助项目、市级优秀创新创业项目评选、社保补贴。\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/t20240511_2024583.htm", "docreltime": "2024.05.11 15:36:00", "doctitle": "人社部门对个人创业有哪些扶持政策？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2199178, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/t20240511_2024583.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2023780, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/t20240509_2023780.htm", "content": "\n　　    职业健康检查是指医疗卫生机构按照国家有关规定，对从事接触职业病危害作业的劳动者进行的上岗前、在岗期间、离岗时的健康检查。上岗前职业健康检查的目的在于掌握劳动者的健康状况，发现职业禁忌；在岗期间", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/t20240509_2023780.htm", "docreltime": "2024.05.09 17:25:00", "doctitle": "为什么要开展职业健康检查？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2198254, "sourcename": "三明市卫健委办公室", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/t20240509_2023780.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2020853, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240426_2020853.htm", "content": "\n　　（1）争当理论武装的“优等生”。持续深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，深挖“人民保护神”等理论和实践的“富矿”，充分运用好三明公安大讲堂、政治轮训、新警培训等载体，提升学习质效，真正练", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240426_2020853.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.26 16:41:00", "doctitle": "市公安局深化拓展“三争”行动，推动“四领一促”工作有哪些具体措施", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2194847, "sourcename": "三明市公安局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240426_2020853.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2019679, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019679.htm", "content": "\n　　重点提升现代种业、竹产业、精品果蔬、农产品加工四个产业，培育行业领军“小巨人”、高附加值“土特产”、强带动力“示范园”，全年实施农业重点项目146个，投资56.14亿元以上，力争实现全市农林牧渔总产值年增", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019679.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.23 11:21:00", "doctitle": "三明市《关于“三农”领域推动“四领一促”工作的实施方案》中“产业领跑”的重点内容是什么？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2193563, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019679.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2019676, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019676.htm", "content": "\n　　“品质激活”行动主要打好“四个攻坚战”：（1）打好村庄清洁“四季”攻坚战，以乡村“五个美丽”创建为载体，加大农村路边、屋边、河边、山边、田边、沟边“六边”整治力度，争创1个全国村庄清洁行动先进县、3", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019676.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.23 11:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市《关于“三农”领域推动“四领一促”工作的实施方案》中实施“品质激活”行动主要做什么？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2193560, "sourcename": "三明市农业农村局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019676.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2019648, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "互动交流知识库", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019648.htm", "content": "\n　　科技创新能够催生新产业、新模式、新动能，是发展新质生产力的核心要素。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shtzszxdtdslycgz/wtjd/202404/t20240423_2019648.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.23 11:09:00", "doctitle": "发展新质生产力的核心要素是什么？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": ""